## Naming Conventions
- Files: snake_case (check_opposites.go)
- Structs: PascalCase (MarketMatch, RoutingDecision)
- Interfaces: PascalCase ending in -er or -or (VenueConnector)
- Functions: PascalCase for exported, camelCase for unexported
- Constants: PascalCase (DefaultTimeout)
- Variables: camelCase (venueScore)
- Test files: same name as file being tested + _test suffix

## What Is Strictly Forbidden
- Never use panic() in production code
- Never swallow errors silently
- Never return raw errors — always wrap in EquinoxError
- Never hardcode API URLs — use config package
- Never hardcode the Anthropic API key — use environment variables
- Never break layer separation for convenience
- Never write implementation before tests (TDD strictly enforced)
- Never use global mutable state
- Never skip the heuristic layer and call AI directly

## Go Version and Module
- Module name: github.com/equinox
- Go version: 1.22
- Keep dependencies minimal and justified
